<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27777" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίωξις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διώκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chase, pursuit,</i> esp. of soldiers or ships,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.33
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.102
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pursuit</i> of an object, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὅλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					192e
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυγή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1139a22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῶν καλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.550e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as law-term,
				<i>prosecution,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίωξιν εἶναι κατὰ τῶν ἐλεγχθέντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.10.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					6.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				45.50
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῶν ἀδικούντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
